ull,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-03T17:16:43Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T22:03:49Z","closed_at":"2025-03-11T22:02:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102373","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102373.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102373.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-11T22:02:48Z"},"body":"Currently for GDExtensions that provide scripting language, fully setup instances can only be created by Godot calling the `_instance_create()` or `_placeholder_instance_create()` virtual methods, because after it calls them, it will do the `Object::set_script_instance()` call.\r\n\r\nHowever, if the GDExtension wants to create instances itself outside of those virtual methods, or to manually set the script instance for any other reason, it can't do that.\r\n\r\nLooking at GDScript and C#, they both use `set_script_instance()` to implement their own internal hot reloading. And C# uses `set_script_and_instance()` in its `tie_user_managed_to_unmanaged()`. This could be useful to other scripting languages from GDExtension for the same reasons.\r\n\r\n**UPDATE:** `Object::set_script_and_instance()` doesn't really seem to be necessary since `Object::set_script_instance()` also sets the script to whatever the script instance has - I'm not really sure why we even have that function! But that's why it's fine to only expose `set_script_instance` and not also `set_script_and_instance`.\r\n\r\nAlso, adding these functions would also bring more parity between Godot modules and GDExtensions, since these are functions that Godot modules can use.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102373/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102373/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}